{
    "chapter_num": 5,
    "verses_count": 13,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Immorality Defiles the Church"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "It is actually reported "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that there is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sexual immorality among you, and such sexual immorality as is not even "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits named"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "named among the Gentiles—that a man has his father’s wife! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And you are "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arrogant"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "puffed up, and have not rather mourned, that he who has done this deed might be taken away from among you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I indeed, as absent in body but present in spirit, have already judged (as though I were present) him who has so done this deed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, when you are gathered together, along with my spirit, with the power of our Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "deliver such a one to Satan for the destruction of the flesh, that his spirit may be saved in the day of the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits Jesus"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Jesus."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Your glorying "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not good. Do you not know that a little leaven leavens the whole lump? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "clean out"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "purge out the old leaven, that you may be a new lump, since you truly are unleavened. For indeed Christ, our Passover, was sacrificed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits for us"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for us. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore let us keep the feast, not with old leaven, nor with the leaven of malice and wickedness, but with the unleavened "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "bread"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of sincerity and truth."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Immorality Must Be Judged"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I wrote to you in my epistle not to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "associate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "keep company with sexually immoral people. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " certainly "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "did"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mean"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with the sexually immoral people of this world, or with the covetous, or extortioners, or idolaters, since then you would need to go out of the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But now I have written to you not to keep company with anyone named a brother, who is sexually immoral, or covetous, or an idolater, or a reviler, or a drunkard, or an extortioner—not even to eat with such a person."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "have"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " I "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to do"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " with judging those also who are outside? Do you not judge those who are inside? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But those who are outside God judges. Therefore "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“put away from yourselves the evil person.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}